    "blurb": "Reduce time to resolve disputes",
    "overview": "Handling credit card fraud disputes can be expensive and time-consuming. This blueprint illustrates how to improve the process and increase customer satisfaction through a combination of automated and manual tasks.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Accelerate dispute handling and increase customer satisfaction",
    "splashDescription": "On average, handling of credit card disputes takes between two business days and two weeks. Manual processing and delays lead to more inbound customer calls, higher cost for resolutions, and reduced customer satisfaction. This blueprint helps automate the handling of fraud disputes with self-service and decision support. It reduces the time-to-market for IT, reduces the cost of dispute resolution for the business, and ultimately improves customer satisfaction.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/449510/overview/img5914350208836245155.png?47d11626ab9eeecc57813d1ba193b296",
